{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f </strong>Samurai Battle Royale Pinball\u00a0<strong>\u2694\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just pinball\u2014it\u2019s war. Step into a <strong>Battle Royale of speed, chaos, and steel</strong>, where the battlefield never stays the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Rotating Samurai Discs</strong> \u2013 Three massive warrior platforms spin at random, shifting the fight every second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Drop Targets &amp; \ud83c\udfaf Bumpers on the Discs</strong> \u2013 Obstacles aren\u2019t fixed\u2026 they rotate into play, blocking shots and forcing new strategies every ball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Unpredictable Action</strong> \u2013 No two matches are ever the same\u2014the rotating gauntlet guarantees fresh challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfef <strong>Cinematic Samurai Theme</strong> \u2013 Warriors duel around you as epic backdrops and dramatic light bring the battlefield to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Battle Royale Mode</strong> \u2013 Survive the chaos, crush the targets, and fight your way to pinball glory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 The table shifts. The warriors move. The targets fight back.<br>Welcome to the <strong>ultimate Samurai Pinball Battle Royale!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079230?t=1759952792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079230/33aff725487d300b8c39eda163cf37e338d6cca4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759952792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079230/6e9a518e2fef71a2d9aa5c2b1b0e97f9e1ad6a62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1